 "notes": "The default region (us-east-1) is not checked: a literal region in the provider block is invisible in the plan. PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: the prompt says external account IDs are granted cross-account ECR access, but the ground truth only declares the external_ecr_accounts variable; its repository policy document grants only omics.amazonaws.com, so only the input (a list variable) is checked. Pass-role, omics:* and S3 read are bound to the policy named HealthOmicsUserPolicy (planned policy document, planned inline policy text, or declared inline text). Read-only is enforced (no s3:PutObject/s3:*/s3:Put*/s3:DeleteObject) only on the policy-document branch; the inline-text branches cannot express a negative. Bucket-ARN scoping of the read-only statements and the SSE key being the same resource as the referenced CMK are not expressible."
}